.TH GFS 1 "2026-08-21" "gfs v0.5.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
gfs \- authenticated web and API door for groot diagnostic archives
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gfs
.br
.B gfs
.BR version | --version | -V
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B gfs
(groot files share) is a VPS service for teams that need one catalog of
.BR groot (1)
.B .tar.gz
diagnostic archives.
It provides session login, scoped API keys, HTTP ingest, a Captures UI, audit
logging, and retention when a VPS is the operator-chosen door.
.PP
Collect, validate, and analyze stay in the
.B groot
CLI.
.B gfs
does
.B not
run
.B groot collect
or embed the collector.
.PP
Deploy-time topologies (see
.B docs/SPECIFICATIONS.md
):
.TP
.B vps
Archives live on VPS disk; listing is local.
.TP
.B vps-s3
HTTP ingest transits staging to an S3-compatible bucket; listing reads the
bucket prefix; cluster jobs may use
.B groot upload.s3
to the same prefix.
.PP
Topology
.B s3
only (no gfs process) is out of scope for this binary.
.SH HTTP ENDPOINTS
.TP
.B GET /healthz
Liveness probe (unauthenticated).
.TP
.B GET /readyz
Readiness: SQLite OK; if S3 is configured, bucket access must succeed.
.TP
.B GET /login
Login form.
.TP
.B POST /login
Username and password \-> session cookie.
.TP
.B GET /
Captures list (session).
.TP
.B GET /v1/archives
JSON archive list (session).
.TP
.B POST /v1/archives
Upload
.B .tar.gz
(session or upload-scoped API key).
.TP
.B GET /v1/archives/{id}
Download archive (session or read-scoped API key).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
Settings use the
.B GFS_*
prefix (see
.B docs/SPECIFICATIONS.md
):
.TP
.B GFS_TOPOLOGY
.BR vps
or
.BR vps-s3
(required).
.TP
.B GFS_DATA_DIR
SQLite database and blob directories (required).
.TP
.B GFS_LISTEN
Listen address (default
.BR :8080 ).
.TP
.B GFS_BOOTSTRAP_ADMIN
.TP
.B GFS_BOOTSTRAP_PASSWORD
First admin when the user table is empty (required then; ignored afterward).
.TP
.B GFS_BOOTSTRAP_ADMIN_NAME
Display name for that admin (default
.BR Administrator ).
.TP
.B GFS_S3_*
Bucket, region, endpoint, prefix for topology
.BR vps-s3 .
.TP
.B AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID
.TP
.B AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY
Required for topology
.BR vps-s3 .
.SH FILES
.B GFS_DATA_DIR
holds
.B gfs.db
, staging, and local archive home.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR groot (1),
.B docs/SPECIFICATIONS.md
.br
Project:
